OL,3,AUK long-term borrowing costs highest
OL,4,Asince 1998 ahead of October Budget
OL,5,
OL,6,FBurnham told the House of Commons his
OL,7,Fgovernment's "bedrock", as it seeks to
OL,8,Ftackle the cost-of-living crisis, would
OL,9,Fbe "fiscal responsibility".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/38
