OL,3,AZelensky says airlines should avoid
OL,4,ARussian airspace as Ukraine escalates
OL,5,Adrone operations
OL,6,
OL,7,FRussian President Vladimir Putin
OL,8,Fresponded by saying that Zelensky's
OL,9,Fcomments amounted to a "declaration of
OL,10,Fstate terrorism". Russia, he added,
OL,11,Fwould continue its attacks on Ukraine
OL,12,Fwhich have intensified in recent weeks.
OL,14,FMost Western commercial airlines do not
OL,15,Ffly over Russia as a consequence of the
OL,16,Fongoing Russian invasion of Ukraine,
OL,17,Fbut carriers in countries such as
OL,18,FTurkey and China do.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/38
